SCOPE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This package publishes:

  - A canonical `ScanEvent` schema for accessibility-compliance tooling.
  - A `JurisdictionPlugin` extension contract for community-authored
    rule packs.
  - A reference orchestrator that runs one jurisdiction at a time and
    emits a `ScanEvent`.

Multi-jurisdiction orchestration, consensus / normalisation heuristics
across multiple jurisdictions in a single pass, and cross-jurisdiction
conflict resolution are out of scope for this package. Community
implementers are free to build their own multi-jurisdiction
orchestrator on top of the `JurisdictionPlugin` contract.
